{"n":7,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1001.00.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"---\naddress: 10.11.21.1001\ntitle: bob\nstate: draft\ntype: general\n---\n\n## Registry\nformat: 7\n\nR10 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:40): face 00 is the registry, the place that lists the page's faces. Layout is `7` (not given).\n\n- `00.draft` registry: draft because sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n- `01.draft` law: draft because sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n- `04.draft` user: draft because sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.1001"}
{"n":8,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1001.01.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"## bob\ntype: brand\nbrand: bob.001\nforms: Bob\nmeans: the user's name\n\n## cats\ntype: brand\nbrand: cats.001\nforms: cats\nmeans: animals the user likes","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.1001"}
{"n":9,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1001.04.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"## bob\nsource: [01 / bob] Bob test session 1, the user's words: \"My name is Bob and I like cats\"; why: docs/spec/brands.md:7\nwhy: When a user explains their meaning of a word, it is recorded, so models look it up instead of guessing.\n\nSession 1, the user said: \"My name is Bob and I like cats\". Bob is the user's name. `7`: no route is written from the question \"what is my name\" to this card. Resolving works on a word the user types (decisions.md C8.8), and the question does not type `bob` (kernel/QUESTIONS.md).\n\n## cats\nsource: [01 / cats] Bob test session 1, the user's words: \"My name is Bob and I like cats\"; why: docs/spec/brands.md:7\nwhy: When a user explains their meaning of a word, it is recorded, so models look it up instead of guessing.\n\nSession 1, the user said: \"My name is Bob and I like cats\". Bob likes cats.","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.1001"}
